{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20247","headline":"吊卢殷 一 · 孟郊","name":"吊卢殷 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗人多清峭，饿死抱空山。\n白云既无主，飞出意等闲。\n久病牀席尸，护丧童仆孱。\n故书穷鼠啮，狼藉一室间。\n君归新鬼乡，我面古玉颜。\n羞见入地时，无人叫追攀。\n百泉空相吊，日久哀潺潺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}